                                        "entry_id": "080cafa2-cf81-3bd3-b439-22018ee6b31f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any predatory fish of the superorder Selachimorpha, with a cartilaginous skeleton and 5 to 7 gill slits on each side of its head."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
